<title>THAILAND: STA Group Q3 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>STA Group Q3 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for STA Group for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss	6.28     loss	   0.23</p>
<p>    Net	    loss    313.98     loss	  11.40</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)   loss    16.26    vs profit	0.03</p>
<p>    Net	    loss   813.08    vs profit	1.36</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is STA Group Plc. The company is a furniture manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
